        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\n\n|User|\nstart\n\nif () then ([Clicks Submit])\n  :1. Confirms submission;\nelse ([Timer expires])\n  |System|\n  :1. Auto-triggers submission;\nendif\n\n|System|\n:2. Collects all selected answers;\n:3. Calculates score;\n:4. Saves results to database;\n:5. Marks attempt as completed;\n:6. Displays result summary;\n\n|User|\n:7. Views test results;\n\nstop\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="A31RTN_mI-qCui1ynbZl-1">
